<span begin="11.970" end="12.458">sign</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但如今你离去 只留下一处标记</span></p><p begin="16.998" end="23.315" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.998" end="17.246">A</span><span begin="17.246" end="17.488">no</span><span begin="17.488" end="17.746">ther</span> <span begin="17.746" end="17.974">eve</span><span begin="17.974" end="18.203">ning</span> <span begin="18.203" end="18.425">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="18.425" end="18.676">be</span> <span begin="18.676" end="18.898">sit</span><span begin="18.898" end="19.125">ting</span> <span begin="19.125" end="19.398">rea</span><span begin="19.398" end="19.655">ding</span> <span begin="19.655" end="20.406">in</span> <span begin="20.406" end="20.617">be</span><span begin="20.617" end="21.320">tween</span> <span begin="21.320" end="21.571">your</span> <span begin="21.571" end="23.315">lines</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">又一个夜晚 我静坐品味你言外之意</span></p><p begin="24.662" end="26.882" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.662" end="24.915">Be</span><span begin="24.915" end="25.145">cause</span> <span begin="25.145" end="25.393">I</span> <span begin="25.393" end="25.661">miss</span> <span begin="25.661" end="25.883">you</span> <span begin="25.883" end="26.122">all</span> <span begin="26.122" end="26.360">the</span> <span begin="26.360" end="26.882">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为我却时刻思念着你</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="26.882" end="27.266"><span begin="26.882" end="27.266">(time)</span></span></p><p begin="30.845" end="32.684" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.845" end="31.196">So,</span> <span begin="31.695" end="31.913">get</span> <span begin="31.913" end="32.193">a</span><span begin="32.193" end="32.684">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以 那就离开吧</span></p><p begin="32.933" end="37.206" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.933" end="33.127">A</span><span begin="33.127"