:lang="zh-CN">让我们于彩虹之上开始</span></p><p begin="46.997" end="47.969" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.997" end="47.246">Turn</span> <span begin="47.246" end="47.508">a</span><span begin="47.508" end="47.969">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">拒绝内心纷扰</span></p><p begin="48.225" end="52.805" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.225" end="48.465">A</span><span begin="48.465" end="48.700">no</span><span begin="48.700" end="48.922">ther</span> <span begin="48.922" end="49.170">way</span> <span begin="49.170" end="49.431">to</span> <span begin="49.431" end="49.914">be</span> <span begin="49.914" end="50.150">where</span> <span begin="50.150" end="50.385">you</span> <span begin="50.385" end="50.632">di</span><span begin="50.632" end="50.870">dn&apos;t</span> <span begin="50.870" end="51.100">want</span> <span begin="51.100" end="51.349">your</span><span begin="51.349" end="51.831">self</span> <span begin="51.831" end="52.025">to</span> <span begin="52.025" end="52.805">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只为让自己不愿继续前行</span></p><p begin="52.805" end="54.450" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.805" end="53.025">Let</span> <span begin="53.025" end="53.272">your</span><span begin="53.272" end="53.772">self</span> <span begin="53.772" end="54.450">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">放任你自己走吧</span></p><p begin="55.452" end="58.009" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.452" end="55.679">Is</span> <span begin="55.679" end="55.914">that</span> <span begin="55.914" end="56.140">a</span> <span begin="56.140" end="56.852">com</span><span begin="56.852" end="57.155">pro</span><span begin="57.155" end="58.009">mise</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这是否等于妥协了呢</span></p><p begin="1:00.662" end="1:04.782" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.662" end="1:00.939">So</span> <span begin="1:00.939" end="1:01.151">what</span> <span begin="1:01.151" end="1