.134" end="1:13.645">top</span> <span begin="1:13.645" end="1:13.903">of</span> <span begin="1:13.903" end="1:14.418">you,</span> <span begin="1:14.418" end="1:14.604">I</span> <span begin="1:14.604" end="1:14.871">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:14.871" end="1:15.117">wan</span><span begin="1:15.117" end="1:15.373">na</span> <span begin="1:15.373" end="1:15.868">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我全心倾覆于你 不愿离去</span></p><p begin="1:15.868" end="1:19.506" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.868" end="1:16.111">&apos;Cause</span> <span begin="1:16.111" end="1:16.357">I</span> <span begin="1:16.357" end="1:16.566">real</span><span begin="1:16.566" end="1:16.805">ly</span> <span begin="1:16.805" end="1:17.032">wan</span><span begin="1:17.032" end="1:17.295">na</span> <span begin="1:17.295" end="1:17.514">stay</span> <span begin="1:17.514" end="1:17.789">at</span> <span begin="1:17.789" end="1:18.355">your</span> <span begin="1:18.355" end="1:19.506">house</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为我真的想要呆在你家里</span></p><p begin="1:19.958" end="1:23.024" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.958" end="1:20.133">And</span> <span begin="1:20.133" end="1:20.611">I</span> <span begin="1:20.611" end="1:20.859">hope</span> <span begin="1:20.859" end="1:21.127">this</span> <span begin="1:21.127" end="1:22.075">works</span> <span begin="1:22.075" end="1:23.024">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">多希望能一直呆着</span></p><p begin="1:23.585" end="1:26.373" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.585" end="1:23.737">But</span> <span begin="1:23.737" end="1:23.973">you</span> <span begin="1:23.973" end="1:24.250">know</span> <span begin="1:24.250" end="1:24.475">how</span> <span begin="1:24.475" end="1:24.712">much</span> <span begin="1:24.712" end="1:24.952">you</span> <span begin="1:24.952" end="1:25.192">broke</span> <span begin="1:25.192" end="1:25.434">me</span> <span begin="1:25.434" end="1:25.923">a</span><span begin="1:25.923" end="1:26.373">part</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但你知道 你令我内心多么分崩离析</span></p><p begin="1:26.373" end="1:29.740" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.373" end="1:26.608">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:26.608" end="1:27.134">done</span> <span begin="1:27.134" end="1:27.383">with</span> <span begin="1:27.383" end="1:27.704">you,</span> <span begin="1:27.892" end="1:28.095">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:28.095" end="1:28.580">ig</span><span begin="1:28.580" end="1:29.028">no</span><span begin="1:29.028" end="1:29.257">ring</span> <span begin="1:29.257" end="1:29.740">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我已经受够你了 我要将你忽视</span></p><p begin="1:29.740" end="1:32.172" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.740" end="1:30.012">I</span> <span begin="1:30.012" end="1:30.257">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:30.257" end="1:30.507">wan</span><span begin="1:30.507" end="1:30.760">na</span> <span begin="1:30.760" end="1:32.172">know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不想再了解了</span></p><p begin="1:41.518" end="1:44.885" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.518" end="1:41.738">And</span> <span begin="1:41.738" end="1:41.971">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:41.971" end="1:42.255">a</span><span begin="1:42.255" end="1:42.478">ware</span> <span begin="1:42.478" end="1:42.741">that</span> <span begin="1:42.741" end="1:42.956">you</span> <span begin="1:42.956" end="1:43.183">were</span> <span begin="1:43.183" end="1:43.412">ly</span><span begin="1:43.412" end="1:43.648">ing</span> <span begin="1:43.648" end="1:43.883">in</span> <span begin="1:43.883" end="1:44.123">the</span> <span begin="1:44.123" end="1:44.383">gut</span><span begin="1:44.383" end="1:44.885">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我意识到 你深陷于恶劣环境中</span></p><p begin="1:49.193" end="1:52.565" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.193" end="1:49.450">&apos;